---
import { CopyEmailButton } from './CopyEmailButton';
---

<section class="w-full bg-mono-50 dark:bg-mono-900 py-16 px-6 lg:px-12" id="contato-rapido">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto bg-white dark:bg-mono-950 border border-mono-200 dark:border-mono-800 p-8 lg:p-12 shadow-sm">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col gap-4">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-mono-500">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-signal-live"></span>
          <span>DISPONÍVEL PARA CONTRATAÇÃO & NOVOS PROJETOS</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold font-headline text-mono-900 dark:text-white uppercase">
          Vamos estruturar sistemas que escalam com resiliência?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-mono-600 dark:text-mono-300 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          Seja para estruturar novas APIs resilientes, desenvolver aplicações completas em Python/FastAPI e TypeScript/React 19, ou integrar sistemas complexos, entre em contato direto.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 pt-2">
          <CopyEmailButton client:load email="lucas.mal2005@gmail.com" />
          
          <a
            class="h-11 px-5 bg-white dark:bg-mono-900 hover:bg-mono-100 dark:hover:bg-mono-850 text-mono-900 dark:text-mono-100 text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase flex items-center gap-2 border border-mono-300 dark:border-mono-700 transition-all"
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lucas-lougon"
            rel="noreferrer"
            target="_blank"
          >
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path
                d="M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14m-.5 15.5v-5.3a3.26 3.26 0 0 0-3.26-3.26c-.85 0-1.84.52-2.28 1.3v-1.11h-2.79v8.37h2.79v-4.93c0-.77.62-1.4 1.39-1.4a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 1.4 1.4v4.93h2.75M6.88 8.56a1.68 1.68 0 0 0 1.68-1.68c0-.93-.75-1.69-1.68-1.69a1.69 1.69 0 0 0-1.69 1.69c0 .93.76 1.68 1.69 1.68m1.39 9.94v-8.37H5.5v8.37h2.77z"
              />
            </svg>
            <span>LinkedIn ↗</span>
          </a>

          <a
            class="h-11 px-5 bg-white dark:bg-mono-900 hover:bg-mono-100 dark:hover:bg-mono-850 text-mono-900 dark:text-mono-100 text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase flex items-center gap-2 border border-mono-300 dark:border-mono-700 transition-all"
            href="https://github.com/LucasAlvesLougon"
            rel="noreferrer"
            target="_blank"
          >
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                clip-rule="evenodd"
                d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.53 1.032 1.53 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z"
              />
            </svg>
            <span>GitHub ↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Specs Summary Box -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 bg-mono-50 dark:bg-mono-900 border border-mono-200 dark:border-mono-800 p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 font-mono">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase text-mono-400 font-semibold">// Garantias de Engenharia</span>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-mono-500 text-xl">schedule</span>
          <div>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-mono-900 dark:text-white">&lt; 24 horas</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-mono-500">Tempo médio de resposta</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-mono-500 text-xl">handshake</span>
          <div>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-mono-900 dark:text-white">Modelos Flexíveis</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-mono-500">Contrato PJ, Full-time ou Consultoria</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-mono-500 text-xl">verified</span>
          <div>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-mono-900 dark:text-white">Código Auditável</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-mono-500">100% testado e com documentação</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
